title Cassette (deck, 640x480 at 11.3 px/mm): the recordings list, keys of the toolkit touch target, rows of the list row minimum
sizes 640x480
ppmm 1130
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key l
wait 400
shot deck-list
expect text "Take 006 selected. Esc returns to the recorder."
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
